<div style="text-align: center;">
<p><em><a href="https://youtu.be/6TX9KvmeXfM">you took what mattered, what mattered the most</a></em><br />
<em><a href="https://youtu.be/6TX9KvmeXfM">AND THIS IS ME TAKING IT BACK</a></em></p>
</div>
<hr />
<p>A while ago, I got the phrase &quot;I was a teenage succubus&quot; stuck in my head. <em>Before</em> that, I didn't like SCP-166. I guess this is killing two birds with one stone, then.</p>
<p>Credit to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/themightymcb" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4483018); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4483018&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1568950753" alt="TheMightyMcB" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4483018)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/themightymcb" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4483018); return false;">TheMightyMcB</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/laneous" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4894577); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4894577&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1568950753" alt="Laneous" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4894577)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/laneous" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4894577); return false;">Laneous</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/henzoid" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5190300); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5190300&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1568950753" alt="Henzoid" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5190300)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/henzoid" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5190300); return false;">Henzoid</a></span> for their crit.</p>

							</div>

